<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Buried! hidden! out of sight!</l><l>Dwelling in the deepest night;</l><l>Losing, underneath the sod,</l><l>Everything, except its God.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Buried, unremember’d, lost</l><l>So thinks man: but all the cost</l><l>God has counted to display</l><l>Life abundant one glad day.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Art thou buried? God’s pure seed</l><l>Doth thy heart in silence bleed?</l><l>Change thy sighing into song,</l><l>Thus alone can harvests come.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
